text:
You can build a plane out of duct tape by:

1. Cutting the duct tape into strips the size of the fuselage and wings;
2. Hand-sewing the strips together and use the seam allowances to assemble the fuselage and wings;
3. Using a glue gun to glue the strips together and use the seam allowances to assemble the fuselage and wings;
4. Using a hot glue gun to glue the strips together and use the seam allowances to assemble the fuselage and wings;
5. Using a glue gun to glue the strips together and use the seam allowances to assemble the fuselage and wings
